<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Nigeria Pry & Sec Result Vault & Scholarship Portal</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; font-family: sans-serif; background-color: #f8fafc; color: #1e293b; }
        .navbar { background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 1rem 2rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50; }
        .logo { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 900; color: #1e3a8a; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .logo span { color: #10b981; }
        .nav-links a { text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin-left: 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .btn-login { color: #2563eb; }
        .btn-reg { background-color: #10b981; color: white; padding: 0.55rem 1.1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; }
        .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 2.5rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
        .hero-split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr; gap: 2.5rem; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
        @media(max-width: 820px) { .hero-split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; } }
        h1 { font-size: 2.35rem; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 1rem 0; line-height: 1.2; }
        p.subtitle { font-size: 1.05rem; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 1.75rem; line-height: 1.6; }
        .cta-btn { background-color: #ea580c; color: white; padding: 1rem 2rem; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 0.75rem; display: inline-block; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.25); }
        .cta-btn:hover { background-color: #c2410c; }
        .hero-img-box { text-align: center; }
        .hero-img-box img { width: 100%; max-width: 340px; border-radius: 1.25rem; box-shadow: 0 15px 30px -10px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.2); border: 4px solid #ffffff; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dbeafe, #d1fae5); padding-top: 1rem; }
        .grant-banner { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a, #1d4ed8); color: white; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.25); text-align: center; }
        .grant-badge { background-color: #f59e0b; color: #0f172a; font-weight: 900; font-size: 0.8rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem; border-radius: 999px; text-transform: uppercase; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 1rem; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
        .prize-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; text-align: left; }
        .prize-item { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25); padding: 1.2rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; }
        .prize-item h4 { margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0; color: #fde68a; font-size: 1.05rem; }
        .prize-item p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #f1f5f9; line-height: 1.45; }
        .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
        .feature-card { background: white; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
        .feature-card h3 { margin-top: 0; color: #1e3a8a; font-size: 1.1rem; }
    </style>
<style>body{position:relative;}body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;background:url("https://wikimedia.org") center/440px no-repeat;opacity:0.055;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;}</style></head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar">
        <a href="/" class="logo">Nigeria Pry & Sec <span>Result Vault</span></a>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="/login" class="btn-login">Log In</a> <a href="/contact" style="margin-left:1rem;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;color:#1e3a8a;">Contact Us</a>
            <a href="/register" class="btn-reg">Sign Up</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-split">
            <div>
                <h1>Secure Your Child's Academic Records From Primary 1 to SSS 3</h1>
                <p class="subtitle">
                    Never lose a terminal report card again. Store, verify, and access official Primary and Secondary school results anytime from your phone or computer.
                </p>
                <a href="/register" class="cta-btn">Create a Student Vault Account</a>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-img-box">
                <img src="/download/hero-students.png" alt="Nigerian Student">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grant-banner">
            <span class="grant-badge">🎓 Annual Student Academic Grant & Tech Award</span>
            <div style="background:#ffffff;color:#1e3a8a;display:inline-block;padding:0.45rem 1.1rem;border-radius:0.5rem;font-weight:900;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);">📅 Next Grant Recipients Announcement: August 14, 2027 (End of 3rd Term Session)</div><br>
            <p style="margin: 0 auto; max-width: 760px; font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.5;">
                <strong>Every verified vault subscription automatically qualifies your child for our End-of-Year Educational Grant, featuring multiple cash and digital device awards across Primary, Junior, and Senior Secondary levels!</strong>
            </p>
            <div class="prize-grid">
                <div class="prize-item">
                    <h4>💰 ₦200,000 – ₦5,000,000 Cash Grants</h4>
                    <p>Direct tuition and educational support funds awarded to selected students across all school levels at year-end.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="prize-item">
                    <h4>💻 Laptops & Digital Learning Devices</h4>
                    <p>Brand-new Laptops, Tablets, and Smartphones to empower your child's digital education.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

                <% if (typeof winners !== 'undefined' && winners.length > 0) { %>
        <div style="background:#ffffff;border:2px solid #f59e0b;border-radius:1.25rem;padding:2rem;margin-bottom:3rem;box-shadow:0 10px 25px -5px rgba(245,158,11,0.15);">
            <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
                <span style="background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:900;font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.35rem 0.9rem;border-radius:999px;text-transform:uppercase;">🏆 Official Grant Announcement</span>
                <h2 style="margin:0.75rem 0 0.25rem;color:#1e3a8a;">Academic Grant & Tech Award Recipients</h2>
                <p style="margin:0;color:#64748b;font-size:0.95rem;">Congratulations to our verified vault students selected for this session's educational grants and devices!</p>
            </div>
            <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:1rem;">
                <% winners.forEach(w => { %>
                <div style="background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;padding:1.2rem;border-radius:0.75rem;">
                    <div style="font-weight:900;font-size:1.1rem;color:#0f172a;">🎓 <%= w.displayName %></div>
                    <div style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:0.5rem;"><%= w.level %> • <%= w.state %></div>
                    <div style="background:#10b981;color:white;display:inline-block;padding:0.25rem 0.65rem;border-radius:0.4rem;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:bold;"><%= w.award %></div>
                </div>
                <% }) %>
            </div>
        </div>
        <% } %>
        <div class="features">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>📁 Complete 12-Year Archive</h3>
                <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.9rem;">Dedicated digital vaults for Primary 1–6, JSS 1–3, and SSS 1–3 across all three academic terms.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>🏫 School Registry Access</h3>
                <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.9rem;">Authorized school administrators can verify and audit student records securely from anywhere.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>🏆 Automatic Grant Entry</h3>
                <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.9rem;">Unlocking any term vault automatically enters your child into our annual cash and device grant selection across all school levels.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
